> ### Name: sample-loo
> ### Title: Approximate leave-one-out cross-validation
> ### Aliases: sample-loo loo.frmtmb_draws waic.frmtmb_draws
> ###   loo_compare.frmtmb_draws psis psis.frmtmb_draws LOO.frmtmb_draws
